# resizeunit: SIGWINCH delivery via signalfd + TaskWaitResize under a pty.
# ptytest sets the window 80x24 at setup.  init probes Io.winSize (80x24) and
# prints it, then arms Io.waitResize + Io.readKey.  `resize 40 12` fires
# SIGWINCH -> the armed waitResize delivers the fresh 40x12 and re-arms.
# 'q' quits via the S3 quit latch while a waitResize is still suspended.
expect 80x24
resize 40 12
expect 40x12
send q
expect_exit 0
